#: Settings.ui.h:26
msgid "Show the dock on"
msgstr "Afichar lo dock sus le"

#: Settings.ui.h:25
msgid "Show on all monitors."
msgstr "Afichar sus totes los ecrans."

#: Settings.ui.h:28
msgid "Position on screen"
msgstr "Posicion sus l'ecran"

#: Settings.ui.h:30
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "Bas"

#: Settings.ui.h:31
msgid "Top"
msgstr "Naut"

#: Settings.ui.h:33
msgid ""
"Hide the dock when it obstructs a window of the current application. More "
"refined settings are available."
msgstr ""
"Amaga lo dock quand geina l'aplicacion principala. D'autres paramètres mai "
"especifics son disponibles."

#: Settings.ui.h:34
msgid "Intelligent autohide"
msgstr "Amagatge intelligent"

#: Settings.ui.h:35
msgid "Dock size limit"
msgstr "Talha maximum del dock"

#: Settings.ui.h:36
msgid "Panel mode: extend to the screen edge"
msgstr "Mòde barra : espandir als bòrds de l'ecran"

#: Settings.ui.h:38
msgid "Icon size limit"
msgstr "Talha maximala de las icònas"

#: Settings.ui.h:39
msgid "Fixed icon size: scroll to reveal other icons"
msgstr "Talha de las icònas fixa : far desfilar per veire las autras icònas"

#: Settings.ui.h:40
msgid "Preview size scale"
msgstr "Talha de las miniaturas de previsualizacion"

#: Settings.ui.h:41
msgid "Position and size"
msgstr "Posicion e talha"

#: prefs.js:242
msgid "Show favorite applications"
msgstr "Afichar las aplicacions favoritas"

#: Settings.ui.h:43
msgid "Show running applications"
msgstr "Afichar las aplicacions en cors"

#: Settings.ui.h:41
msgid "Isolate workspaces."
msgstr "Isolar los espacis de trabalh."

#: Settings.ui.h:42
msgid "Show urgent windows despite current workspace."
msgstr ""
"Afichar las fenèstras urgentas en defòra de l’airal de trabalh en "
"utilizacion."

#: Settings.ui.h:43
msgid "Isolate monitors."
msgstr "Isolar los monitors."

#: Settings.ui.h:44
msgid "Show open windows previews."
msgstr "Afichar d'apercebuts de fenèstras."

#: Settings.ui.h:48
msgid "Keep the focused application always visible in the dash"
msgstr "Manténer l’aplicacion seleccionada totjorn visibla en lo dock"

#: Settings.ui.h:49
msgid ""
"If disabled, these settings are accessible from gnome-tweak-tool or the "
"extension website."
msgstr ""
"Se desactivats, aqueles paramètres son accessibles via gnome-tweak-tool o lo "
"site d'extension GNOME."

#: Settings.ui.h:50
msgid "Show <i>Applications</i> icon"
msgstr "Afichar l'acorchi <i>Afichar las Aplicacions</i>"

#: Settings.ui.h:48
msgid "Move the applications button at the beginning of the dock."
msgstr "Plaçar lo boton de las aplicacions en primièra posicion"

#: Settings.ui.h:49
msgid "Animate <i>Show Applications</i>."
msgstr "Animar l'acorchi <i>Afichar las Aplicacions</i>"

#: Settings.ui.h:54
msgid "Show trash can"
msgstr "Mostrar l’escobilhièr"

#: Settings.ui.h:55
msgid "Show volumes and devices"
msgstr "Afichar los volumes e los periferics"

#: Settings.ui.h:56
msgid "Only if mounted"
msgstr "Sonque se montats"

#: Settings.ui.h:57
msgid "Include network volumes"
msgstr "Inclure los volumes ret"

#: Settings.ui.h:58
msgid "Isolate volumes, devices and trash windows from file manager"
msgstr "Dobrir los volumes, periferics e l’escobilhièr a despart."

#: Settings.ui.h:65
msgid "Launchers"
msgstr "Aviadors"

#: Settings.ui.h:66
msgid ""
"Enable Super+(0-9) as shortcuts to activate apps. It can also be used "
"together with Shift and Ctrl."
msgstr ""
"Activar Super+(0-9) coma acorchis per activar las aplicacions. Lo se pòt "
"utilizar tanben amb Shift e Ctrl."

#: Settings.ui.h:67
msgid "Use keyboard shortcuts to activate apps"
msgstr "Utilizar d'acorchis de clavièr per activar las aplicacions"

#: Settings.ui.h:68
msgid "Behaviour when clicking on the icon of a running application."
msgstr "Comportament del clic sus l'icòna d'una aplicacion dobèrta."

#: Settings.ui.h:69
msgid "Click action"
msgstr "Accion del clic"

#: Settings.ui.h:70
msgid "Minimize"
msgstr "Minimizar la fenèstra"

#: Settings.ui.h:71
msgid "Behaviour when scrolling on the icon of an application."
msgstr "Comportament al moment del desfilament sus l'icòna d'una aplicacion."

#: Settings.ui.h:72
msgid "Scroll action"
msgstr "Accion del desfilament"

#: Settings.ui.h:73
msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "Far pas res"

#: Settings.ui.h:74
msgid "Switch workspace"
msgstr "Cambiar d'espaci de trabalh"

#: Settings.ui.h:75
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Comportament"

#: Settings.ui.h:80
msgid ""
"Few customizations meant to integrate the dock with the default GNOME theme. "
"Alternatively, specific options can be enabled below."
msgstr ""
"Assortir lo dock amb lo tèma per defaut. Siquenon, podètz personalizar "
"qualques paramètres çaijós."

#: Settings.ui.h:81
msgid "Use built-in theme"
msgstr "Utilizar lo tèma per defaut"

#: Settings.ui.h:76
msgid "Save space reducing padding and border radius."
msgstr "Reduire la talha dels marges per ganhar de plaça."

#: Settings.ui.h:77
msgid "Shrink the dash"
